<title>USA: Viacom stock jumps after earnings results.</title>
<headline>Viacom stock jumps after earnings results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viacom Inc's stock was up about 1-1/2 points on Friday after third quarter earnings were driven higher by gains in the company's MTV Networks and Paramount segments.</p>
<p>MTV's revenues and earnings before interest, tax, depreciation and amortization grew by 27 percent to $349 million and $149 million, respectively.</p>
<p>The cable television segment also posted double-digit gains in affiliate fees and advertising sales, led by a continued outstanding performance at it's Nickelodeon &quot;Nick at Nite&quot; cable network.</p>
</text>
